{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03E7A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"小心，Snake！我完全不知道Basilisco会使出什么样的攻击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不过，体型大应该也不全是好处。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"动作大概也会很明显……大多数攻击应该都会有某种前摇。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"有这个可能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"一开始也许最好先观察它的行动，记住各种攻击的前摇。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这样一来，大多数攻击应该都能躲开。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"另外，既然是步行兵器，该瞄准哪里自然也就明确了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"腿。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"对。破坏它的腿，应该就能让它无法行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"顺利的话，说不定还能让它摔倒。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不过，可别被倒下的Peace Walker压在下面。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""}]}